include README.md
include LICENSE.txt
include pyproject.toml

recursive-include alegrapy *.py py.typed
recursive-include alegra *.py

prune tests
prune docs
prune odd
prune env
prune site
prune build
prune dist
prune AlegraPy.egg-info
prune alegrapy.egg-info

exclude config.ini
exclude alegra.log
exclude main.py
exclude RELEASING.md

global-exclude *.py[cod]
global-exclude __pycache__
global-exclude *.log
